# Your actual portfolio data stays local.
# Ignore the whole folder, not named files: ad-hoc backups get names nobody
# thought of when the pattern was written — "portfolio.pre-lots-backup.json"
# slipped past an earlier `data/*.backup.json` rule and would have been
# committed. Everything in here is personal data, so everything is ignored.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
